<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>StartSchool Key Card Agreement</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=Noto+Serif:wght@400;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      @page {
        size: A4;
        margin: 2cm;
      }
      body {
        font-family: "Noto Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif;
        font-size: 11pt;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #111;
        margin: 0;
      }
      h1 {
        font-family: "Noto Sans", "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 16pt;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 0.5cm 0;
      }
      p {
        margin: 0 0 0.4em 0;
      }
      .date-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin: 0 0 0.8cm 0;
      }
      .subhead {
        font-family: "Noto Sans", "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 12pt;
        margin: 0.5cm 0 0.2cm 0;
      }
      ul {
        margin: 0.2em 0 0.4em 0;
        padding-left: 1.6em;
      }
      ul ul {
        margin: 0.1em 0 0.2em 0;
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 0.25em;
      }
      .sig-h {
        font-family: "Noto Sans", "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 13pt;
        margin: 1cm 0 0.3cm 0;
      }
      .signatures {
        margin-top: 0.4cm;
        page-break-inside: avoid;
      }
      .signatures .sig-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        margin-bottom: 0.8cm;
      }
      .signatures .sig-label {
        width: 6cm;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-family: "Noto Sans", "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
      }
      .signatures .sig-line {
        flex: 1;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
        min-height: 1.5em;
      }
      .on-behalf {
        font-style: italic;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>StartSchool Key Card Agreement</h1>

    <div class="date-row">
      <span>Riga</span>
      <span>Date of the digital signature</span>
    </div>

    <p>
      The contract stipulates the agreement between Tech Education Foundation,
      hereinafter StartSchool, address at Stabu iela 50-9, LV-1011 Rīga,
      Latvia, registration No. 50008325331, represented by its Campus Manager,
      Janis Altgauzens and {{signer.name}} {{signer.surname}}, hereinafter
      Student.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Startup House Riga, StartSchool office - key card</strong>: 1
      pcs.
    </p>

    <p class="subhead">
      The student has read the StartSchool Office Terms of Use:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>The student is responsible for the key card and does not give it to
        third parties.</li>
      <li>The office is our home and the student also is responsible for it:
        <ul>
          <li>let's keep it clean.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>The student is using the office on working days 8:00-18:00
        <ul>
          <li>In StartupHouse Riga, the Student can use:
            <ul>
              <li>1st floor - Kitchen, wardrobe, event space.</li>
              <li>4th floor - StartSchool office.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Any community events planned by the Student must be approved by the
        StartSchool team (Janis Altgauzens, Arina Li, Anna Andersone.)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="sig-h">Signatures of the Parties</h2>
    <div class="signatures">
      <div class="sig-row">
        <div class="sig-label">The Student:</div>
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sig-row">
        <div class="sig-label">The StartSchool:</div>
        <div class="sig-line"></div>
      </div>
      <p class="on-behalf">
        Janis Altgauzens on behalf of Tech Education Foundation
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
